{% include "commercial/vertical-schema.njk" %}
<main class="mp-page{% if service.slug == 'msp-lead-generation' %} mp-calling-page{% endif %}">
<div class="mp-hero-shell"><div class="mp-wrap">
<nav class="mp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/services/">Services</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ service.name }}</span></nav>
<div class="mp-hero"><div><p class="mp-kicker">{{ service.kicker }}</p><h1>{{ service.headline | safe }}</h1><p class="mp-lead">{{ service.lead }}</p><p>{{ service.intro }}</p><div class="mp-actions"><a class="mp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="hero">{{ service.book }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="mp-text-link" href="#scope">Explore campaign scope ↓</a></div><p class="mp-small">Free 30-minute strategy call. Discuss your offer, audience and sales process.</p></div>
<aside class="mp-pipeline"><div class="mp-panel-top"><span>Account → Conversation → Handoff</span><span>01 / 04</span></div><h2>{{ service.panel | safe }}</h2><ol>{% for stage in service.stages %}<li><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><div><strong>{{ stage[0] }}</strong><p>{{ stage[1] }}</p></div></li>{% endfor %}</ol><div class="mp-panel-bottom">Research prepares the account. People conduct the calls. Your team develops the sale.</div></aside></div>
<div class="mp-answer"><p class="mp-kicker">The service in plain English</p><p>{{ service.summary }}</p></div></div></div>
<nav class="mp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="mp-wrap"><a href="#scope">Campaign scope</a><a href="#qualification">Qualification</a><a href="#conversations">Buyer objections</a><a href="#proof">Evidence</a><a href="#investment">Investment</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a></div></nav>
<section class="mp-section" id="scope"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">01 / The campaign brief</p><h2>{{ service.scopeTitle | safe }}</h2><p>{{ service.scopeIntro }}</p></div><div class="mp-scope-grid">{% for item in service.scope %}<article><span class="mp-step">0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ item[0] }}</h3><p>{{ item[1] }}</p><p class="mp-output"><strong>Working output</strong> {{ item[2] }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div><p class="mp-caption">Need the broader delivery model? Explore <a href="/services/b2b-lead-generation/">managed B2B lead generation</a> and <a href="/services/b2b-cold-calling/">the calling service</a>. This page defines the additional decisions for your market.</p></div></section>
<section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="qualification"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">02 / Protect the first meeting</p><h2>{{ service.qualificationTitle | safe }}</h2><p>{{ service.qualificationText }}</p><ul class="mp-checks">{% for item in service.checks %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><p><a href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Use the Meeting Quality Check</a> to distinguish bookings, attendance, sales acceptance and opportunity creation.</p></div><aside class="mp-note"><p class="mp-label">{{ service.exampleLabel }}</p><h3>{{ service.exampleTitle }}</h3><dl>{% for item in service.example %}<div><dt>{{ item[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ item[1] }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl><p class="mp-small">Example of a useful information structure. Facts are established in conversation, not filled in by assumption.</p></aside></div></section>
<section class="mp-section" id="conversations"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">03 / What buyers may say</p><h2>{{ service.objectionsTitle | safe }}</h2></div><div class="mp-scope-grid">{% for item in service.objections %}<article><h3>{{ item[0] }}</h3><p>{{ item[1] }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="follow-through"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">04 / Responsibilities after booking</p><h2>{{ service.followTitle | safe }}</h2><p>{{ service.follow }}</p></div><div class="mp-tool"><p class="mp-label">Measure the progression</p><h3>Review what happened next.</h3><p>{{ service.metrics }}</p><p>Choose the reporting fields and review cadence in the campaign scope. Sales feedback should explain the outcome, not just change a status.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="mp-section" id="fit"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">05 / Is the service a fit?</p><h2>{{ service.fitTitle | safe }}</h2></div><div class="mp-fit-grid"><div><ul class="mp-checks">{% for item in service.fit %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><div class="mp-fit-note"><h3>Agree the boundaries before launch.</h3><p>{{ service.fitNote }}</p><p>For an existing database, see <a href="/services/lead-reactivation/">lead reactivation</a>. For a wider front-of-sales function, consider <a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/">outsourced SDR services</a>.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="mp-section mp-proof" id="proof"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">06 / Published campaign evidence</p><h2>Read the result.<br>Keep the context.</h2><p>{{ service.proofIntro }}</p></div>{% set proofCases = service.cases %}{% include "commercial/proof.njk" %}</div></section>
<section class="mp-section" id="investment"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">07 / Price and scope</p><h2>Budget for the work<br>your campaign needs.</h2><p class="mp-price">From US$4,000<span> / month</span></p><p>The campaign-ready starting program assumes usable target accounts or contacts, a defined offer and market, CRM and calendar access, and sellers available for meetings.</p><p>Fresh research, data licensing, validation, extra markets and additional resources affect the final scope. Most programs begin with an initial three-month engagement. The written proposal sets your actual work and terms.</p><a class="mp-text-link" href="/pricing/">Review pricing and starting assumptions →</a></div><aside class="mp-tool"><p class="mp-label">Use your customer economics</p><h3>What return would justify the investment?</h3><p>Model your contract value, gross margin, acquisition cost and conversion assumptions. Include your own sales and onboarding work when assessing the business case.</p><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-lead-generation-roi-calculator/">Calculate Your Campaign ROI ↗</a><p class="mp-small">Illustrative estimates from your inputs. No sales or revenue guarantee.</p></aside></div></section>
<section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="launch"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">08 / Start with a workable brief</p><h2>Bring the offer.<br>Define the next conversation.</h2><p>We review your market, evidence, data readiness and sales capacity before recommending scope. Then agree the messaging, acceptance criteria and follow-up responsibilities.</p></div><div class="mp-tool-band"><div><h3>Explore an approach to your audience.</h3><p>Use your offer, buyer and territory to build a starting campaign plan.</p></div><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/">See How We’d Run Your Campaign ↗</a></div><p class="mp-caption">Useful preparation: {{ service.resources | safe }}</p></div></section>
{% set faqHeading = service.name + ": buying questions." %}{% set faqIntro = "Confirm the fit, responsibilities and terms before commissioning a campaign." %}{% include "commercial/faq.njk" %}
<section class="mp-final"><div class="mp-wrap"><p class="mp-kicker">Discuss the market before the commitment</p><h2>{% if service.slug == 'saas-appointment-setting' %}Make the next demo<br>about the buyer’s work.{% else %}Build your next conversation<br>around the right IT client.{% endif %}</h2><p>Bring your audience, offer and current prospecting gap. We’ll review what a focused campaign would need.</p><a class="mp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="closing">Book a Free 30-Minute Strategy Call ↗</a><a class="mp-final-text" href="#contact">Send your campaign question instead →</a></div></section>
</main>
